   "name": "typeid",
   "abstract": "TypeID type for PostgreSQL",
   "description": "TypeID is a type-safe, K-sortable, globally unique identifier built on UUIDv7. This extension adds a native `typeid` type storing a prefix plus a binary UUID, with comparison operators, btree and hash operator classes, min/max aggregates and generation functions.",
